Subject: [PATCH 50/53] Automated playtest through the first gym

tools/hack/playtest/: a headless mGBA harness (button scripts, screenshots
and save-block reads) and playtest.py, which builds scenario ROMs and runs
six milestone checks through Brock (boot menu, wild Exp. + level cap,
trainer battle, Nuzlocke catch rule, gym double battle, Brock's gym
script), confirming each by reading flags, vars and the party.

